{
  "about": "Tidy up Fire TV: the Amazon extras Offshore may offer to switch off. One list, used by the app (Settings and setup, to show the choices and whether each is on) and by tools/setup_tv.ps1 (which only ever touches packages listed in 'items', never one matching 'never'). Switching off is pm disable-user (reversible, nothing is uninstalled). Only items installed on a TV are shown there, so one list serves every Fire TV model. Add a package only after trying it on a real TV; when unsure, leave it out.",
  "version": 1,
